From: Red Locomotive <67845085+redLocomotive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 10:32:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/30] web: Emscripten integration -- async-extras re-detect,
 Donate link, fullscreen

Mostly #ifdef __EMSCRIPTEN__. web_rescan_data_dirs() re-runs set_game_dir() after the async extras.data mounts (re-enables encyclopedia/scenario/tutorial/music); the menu re-checks the encyclopedia flag live. A gold Donate bitmap (donate_img.h) is blitted on the menu and opens ko-fi; Quit drops fullscreen instead of freezing the tab; scenario/tutorial show a 'still downloading' note until extras arrive.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
